A bunch of programs that use wily for their user interface,
and tools to create such programs.

Current:
- python3	python3 interface for wily messages
- win		simple terminal
- quanstro	tools from erik quanstrom <quanstro@Infomkt.ibm.com>


Legacy:
- old		stuff pre wily-0.11
- python	python interface for wily messages
- wpnews	wily/python news reader

